        "original_id": "2446c24b-bb2d-5193-9bc5-bb608d2c57c1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Lianzhou, Yancheng, Guangdong Province, Jiangsu Province, Qingyuan, Xingzi Town, Momianshi, Yangshan, Yingde, China\n- Systems: county-level cities, prefecture-level cities, rivers\n\nFacts:\n- Lianzhou, formerly called Lian County or Lianxian and historically romanized as Linhsien, is a county-level city in northern Guangdong Province, China.\n- Lianzhou is administered by the prefecture-level city of Qingyuan.\n- Yancheng is a prefecture-level city in northeastern Jiangsu Province, China.\n- The Lianjiang River rises at Momianshi in Xingzi Town in Lianzhou county.\n- The Lianjiang River flows generally from northwest to southeast through Lianzhou, Yangshan, and Yingde counties.",
